##CASE lessence-fo2 groups=2
##WHY a large identical payload must not outvote the words naming the event:
##WHY the two Updating lines fold together, Active stays out
##FROM rancher TLS shape; a multiset alone merged Updating into Active
2025/09/14 07:25:53 [INFO] Updating TLS secret for system/serving-cert (count: 407): map[cn-a:1 cn-b:2 cn-c:3]
2025/09/14 07:25:56 [INFO] Updating TLS secret for system/tls-internal (count: 96): map[cn-a:1 cn-b:2 cn-c:3]
2025/09/14 07:25:53 [INFO] Active TLS secret / (ver=) (count 5): map[cn-a:1 cn-b:2 cn-c:3]

##CASE lessence-pms groups=1
##WHY one inserted token must not cascade into a near-zero similarity score
##FROM the positional-byte comparison the token LCS replaced
worker started handling batch alpha beta gamma delta epsilon
worker started now handling batch alpha beta gamma delta epsilon
worker started handling batch alpha beta gamma delta epsilon

##CASE lessence-cau groups=1
##WHY a non-ASCII line folds without panicking on a byte offset
##FROM UTF-8 slicing used to cut mid-character
INFO anvandaren kunde inte autentiseras mot servern alg
INFO anvandaren kunde inte autentiseras mot servern bjorn
INFO anvandaren kunde inte autentiseras mot servern rav

##CASE lessence-21f51de groups=3
##WHY structured messages keep their content instead of collapsing into one group
##FROM cilium logfmt shape; three distinct messages, one component
level=info msg="starting the scheduler" component=core
level=info msg="stopping the scheduler" component=core
level=info msg="reloading the scheduler" component=core

##CASE lessence-s53 template_absent=<FQDN>
##WHY a dotted source-file reference is not a hostname
##FROM prometheus shape; v0.4.1 normalized caller=checkpoint.go to caller=<FQDN>
ts=2025-09-19T03:00:27.455Z caller=checkpoint.go:101 level=info component=tsdb msg="Creating checkpoint"

##CASE lessence-s53 template_absent=<FQDN>
##WHY a dotted class identifier is not a hostname
##FROM stock Hadoop text; v0.4.1 normalized dfs.DataNode to <FQDN>
081109 203615 148 INFO dfs.DataNode$PacketResponder: PacketResponder 1 for block blk_38865049064139660 terminating

##CASE lessence-s53 template_absent=<FQDN>
##WHY a dotted method identifier is not a hostname
##FROM stock Apache mod_jk text; v0.4.1 normalized workerEnv.init() to <FQDN>()
[Sun Dec 04 04:47:44 2005] [notice] workerEnv.init() ok /etc/httpd/conf/workers2.properties

##CASE lessence-qkj template_absent=<UUID>
##WHY the ordinary English word request is not a request id
##FROM stock Kubernetes text; v0.4.1 rewrote it to `cancel request_id=<UUID> for`
W0909 13:07:12.237366    3116 transport.go:356] Unable to cancel request for *otelhttp.Transport

##CASE a585a63 template_absent=<HASH>
##WHY a bracketed pid is a pid, not a hash
