Jan 26 00:00:05 d2-4-bhs5 sshd[3578055]: Invalid user sammy from 35.246.248.48 port 47192

##CASE lessence-zbu template_absent=<PID>
##WHY a parenthesised count is not a pid
##FROM the is_likely_pid gate the paren replacement used to skip
retrying the upload after a short delay (3)

