Jan 26 00:00:05 d2-4-bhs5 sshd[3578055]: Invalid user sammy from 35.246.248.48 port 47192
Jan 26 00:01:11 d2-4-bhs5 sshd[3578112]: Invalid user deploy from 35.246.248.48 port 47444
